  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is a monotonically decreasing function of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> in the largest possible interval <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo></math>, then</p>\r",
